 "text": "Offices | Arthur County, Nebraska\nSkip to main content\nAll State Agencies | All State Services\nArthur County, Nebraska\n| ×\n|\n| |\n|\nCustom Search\n| Sort by\nRelevance\nDate\n|\nMain menu\nHome\nAbout\nOffices ▶\nAssessor\nAttorney\nClerk\nClerk of the District Court\nCommissioners\nCounty Court\nExtention Educator\nHighway Superintendent\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nVeterans Services Officer\nWeed Superintendent\nZoning Administrator\nServices\nPhoto Gallery\nOffices\nThe courthouse that was built in 1914 and served the citizens for the next 48 years gained notoriety for possibly being the smallest courthouse in the United States. It was replaced by the county's present courthouse in 1962.\nOffices\n|\nAssessor |\nAttorney |\nBoard of Commissioners |\nClerk |\nClerk District Court |\nHighway Superintendent |\nEmergency Manager |\nSheriff |\nRegister of Deeds |\nVeterans Services Officer |\nTreasurer |\nZoning Administrator |\nWeed Superintendent |\nCounty Court |\nExtension Educator |\n|\n205 Fir St. | Arthur, NE 69121 | Phone: (308) 764-2201 | Contact Webmaster | Nebraska.gov | Policies | Login\n| |",
